&lt;/div&gt;</content><link href="https://news.hket.com/article/4133626/%E8%83%BD%E6%BA%90%E5%83%B9%E6%A0%BC%EF%BD%9C%E9%BB%83%E5%82%91%E9%BE%8D%E6%96%99%E5%85%A9%E9%9B%BB%E7%87%83%E6%96%99%E8%B2%BB8%E6%9C%88%E9%81%94%E9%AB%98%E5%B3%B0%E3%80%80%E8%AA%8D%E7%82%BA%E6%B8%AF%E7%87%88%E8%BD%89%E7%94%A8%E7%87%83%E7%85%A4%E9%9D%9E%E4%B8%8D%E5%8F%AF%E8%A1%8C?mtc=20023"/><published>2026-05-25T14:32:00+08:00</published></entry><entry><id>https://news.hket.com/article/4133627/%E6%94%BE%E7%94%9F%EF%BD%9C%E6%BC%81%E8%AD%B7%E7%BD%B2%E5%B7%A1%E6%9F%A5%E7%86%B1%E9%96%80%E5%9C%B0%E9%BB%9E%E3%80%80%E6%B4%BE%E7%99%BC%E5%AE%A3%E5%82%B3%E5%96%AE%E5%BC%B5%E5%91%BC%E7%B1%B2%E6%94%BE%E7%94%9F%E5%89%8D%E4%BB%94%E7%B4%B0%E8%80%83%E6%85%AE?mtc=20023</id><title>放生｜漁護署巡查熱門地點　派發宣傳單張呼籲放生前仔細考慮</title><updated>2026-05-25T14:49:00+08:00</updated><content type="html">

&lt;p&gt;Published on: 2026-05-24T14:49:19.819+08:00 Updated on: 2026-05-24T14:49:19.819+08:00&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class="article-detail-content-container"&gt;
&lt;div class="non-paywall"&gt;
&lt;p&gt;部分市民會趁佛誕放生積福，實際卻有機會導致被放生的動物死亡和影響生態。漁護署今日（24日）派員巡查常見放生活動地點，包括大埔碗窰、上水梧桐河、西貢公眾碼頭及西灣河渡輪碼頭等，並在該些地點派發宣傳單張，呼籲市民放生動物前必須謹慎思量。&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div&gt; &lt;div class="grouped-image-container"&gt;
&lt;span class="click-to-enlarge"&gt;&lt;span&gt;▼&lt;/span&gt;點擊圖片放大&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;div class="grouped-image-wrapper"&gt;
&lt;div class="article-detail_grouped-image block"&gt;
&lt;picture class="image-gallery-img"&gt;
&lt;source data-srcset="https://static04.hket.com/res/v3/image/content/4130000/4133627/A2CED91F41064AE991C04FE25C4CEBE8_O_600.jpeg" media="(min-width: 1200px)"/&gt;
&lt;source data-srcset="https://static04.hket.com/res/v3/image/content/4130000/4133627/A2CED91F41064AE991C04FE25C4CEBE8_O_300.jpeg" media="(min-width: 1024px)"/&gt;
&lt;source data-srcset="https://static04.hket.com/res/v3/image/content/4130000/4133627/A2CED91F41064AE991C04FE25C4CEBE8_O_600.jpeg" media="(min-width: 600px)"/&gt;
&lt;source data-srcset="https://static04.hket.com/res/v3/image/content/4130000/4133627/A2CED91F41064AE991C04FE25C4CEBE8_O_300.jpeg" media="(min-width: 0px)"/&gt;
&lt;img alt="" class="lazyload" data-alt="漁護署派員到熱門放生地點巡視，以及派發宣傳單張。（政府新聞處圖片）" data-link="" data-src="https://static04.hket.com/res/v3/image/content/4130000/4133627/A2CED91F41064AE991C04FE25C4CEBE8_O_600.jpeg" src="https://static04.hket.com/res/v3/image/content/4130000/4133627/A2CED91F41064AE991C04FE25C4CEBE8_O_600.jpeg" style="max-width:100%; height:auto;"/&gt;
&lt;/picture&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
